* Speech interface: make a request, confirm the recognized details, and correct if needed.
Goal: Set a reminder with a speech interface
. Goal: Initiate voice interaction
.. Look at <voice assistant button>
.. Touch <voice assistant button>
.. Verify speech interface is listening
. Goal: State reminder request
.. Recall <task> and <time>
.. Say Remind me to <task> at <time>
. Goal: Confirm recognized reminder
.. Hear <recognized task> at <recognized time>
.. Verify <recognized task> matches <task> and <recognized time> matches <time>
. Goal: Confirm reminder
.. Say Yes
.. Hear <reminder confirmation>
.. Verify reminder is set
